---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy | H.K. Hangluah"
  description="Privacy practices for the personal academic website of H. Kapginlian Hangluah."
>
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-10 sm:py-16 space-y-8 font-serif">
    <div class="border-b border-[var(--border-color)] pb-6 font-sans">
      <span class="text-xs font-mono uppercase tracking-wider text-[var(--accent)] font-semibold">
        Data Integrity
      </span>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-[var(--text-primary)] mt-1.5 mb-2">
        Privacy Policy
      </h1>
      <p class="text-sm text-[var(--text-secondary)] font-mono">
        Last updated: October 2026
      </p>
    </div>

    <section class="space-y-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-[var(--text-primary)]">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold font-sans tracking-tight text-[var(--text-primary)]">
        1. Zero Tracking & No Advertising Cookies
      </h2>
      <p>
        This website is built as an ultra-fast static site. We do not use third-party marketing trackers, cross-site profiling cookies, or programmatic advertising networks. Your reading activity is completely private.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold font-sans tracking-tight text-[var(--text-primary)] pt-4">
        2. Local Storage Preferences
      </h2>
      <p>
        The only client-side data stored in your browser is a single key in <code class="text-xs font-mono bg-[var(--bg-secondary)] px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded">localStorage</code> (`color-theme`) used solely to remember whether you selected Light Mode or Dark Mode.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold font-sans tracking-tight text-[var(--text-primary)] pt-4">
        3. Email Correspondence
      </h2>
      <p>
        If you send an email inquiry regarding linguistic consultations or research data, your contact email is never sold, shared, or added to automated marketing lists.
      </p>
    </section>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
